title: Start
---
You are in an old decrepet office, staring from the window besides the dirty desk.
[i]It has been raining non-stop for three days now[/i]. The window is lined with tiny ice particles from the outside.
It's cold. Very cold.
On the desk there is a picture. A man and a woman. Next to it, a phone, [select value={$phoneplugged} True="plugged" False="unplugged" /].

-> pick up phone
    <<if $phoneplugged == false>>
            You hear nothing.
            ->go back
            <<jump Start>>
    <<else>>
            You pick up the phone. A low pitched tune plays, waiting for you to call someone.
            ->call 555-111-222
                After three distinct tunes, you hear her voice: Hello, this is Eliza, I cannot reach the phone right now but feel free to leave a message after the tone.
            ->go back
            <<jump Start>>
    <<endif>>
-> plug phone
    The phone is now plugged.
    <<set $phoneplugged to true>>
    <<jump Start>>
-> inspect photo
    The man's face resembles yours, but he's much more young, energetic, and alive.
    The woman, happy to be next to him. On the back of the photo, the number 555-111-222 is written.
    <<jump Start>>

Anyway, time to get writing!
===
